        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>The logic followed here is:-</p>\n\n<p>1)&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/61c99f13c8e09a55c8ae2b9e_16421569569601.png\" style=\"\" /> move 90<sup>0</sup>&nbsp;clockwise direction.</p>\n\n<p>2) Letters F and J move corner to corner clockwise direction and after the rotating letter F and J&nbsp;change its position&nbsp;in anticlockwise direction and so on.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>So, the figure is given below:-</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F2_Puja%20T_19-01-22_Savita_D30.png\" style=\" width: 317px; height: 81px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence,<strong> &quot;option 1&quot;</strong> is the correct answer.</p>\n",
      "images": [
