    {
      "id": "0bbd5d8f3f63-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "Select the figure that will come next in the following series.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Select the figure that will come next in the following series.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Prashant.T_15-04-21_Savita_D1.png\" style=\"width: 421px; height: 81px;\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Prashant.T_15-04-21_Savita_D2.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 82px;\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Prashant.T_15-04-21_Savita_D3.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 81px;\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Prashant.T_15-04-21_Savita_D4.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 81px;\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Prashant.T_15-04-21_Savita_D5.png\" />"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>The logic follows here is</p>\n\n<p>1. The&nbsp;symbols are moving in 90 degrees in Clockwise direction.</p>\n\n<p>2. The symbols are changing the positions diagonally.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>According to the logic the complete sequence of the series is:-</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Prashant.T_15-04-21_Savita_D6.png\" style=\"width: 420px; height: 81px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>The image 5 is the continuous of the previous image.</p>\n\n<p>Hence, The correct&nbsp; answer is <strong>Option 4</strong>.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Prashant.T_15-04-21_Savita_D1.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Prashant.T_15-04-21_Savita_D2.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Prashant.T_15-04-21_Savita_D3.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Prashant.T_15-04-21_Savita_D4.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Prashant.T_15-04-21_Savita_D5.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/04/F1_Prashant.T_15-04-21_Savita_D6.png"
      ],
