    {
      "id": "0bbd5d8f3f63-q4",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "Which figure will replace the question mark (?) in the figure series?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Which figure will replace the question mark (?) in the&nbsp;figure series?</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Bubun.R_09-03-21_Savita_D9.png\" style=\"width: 497px; height: 81px;\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Bubun.R_09-03-21_Savita_D10.png\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 99px;\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Bubun.R_09-03-21_Savita_D11.png\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 100px;\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Bubun.R_09-03-21_Savita_D12.png\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 99px;\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Bubun.R_09-03-21_Savita_D13.png\" style=\"width: 100px; height: 101px;\" />"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>The pattern followed here is:</p>\n\n<p>Imagine the diagram is divided into four quadrants,</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/quesImage5146.png\" style=\"height: 153px; width: 180px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>The pattern followed for each shape is as follows:</p>\n\n<p>Step 1) The II&nbsp;quadrant element moves to the I quadrant in the next figure.</p>\n\n<p>Step 2) The I&nbsp;quadrant element moves to the III quadrant in the next figure, then it vanishes in the next figure.</p>\n\n<p>Step 3) The IV&nbsp;quadrant element goes to the II quadrant in the next&nbsp;figure.</p>\n\n<p>The centre&nbsp;element moves to the IV quadrant in the next figure.</p>\n\n<p>Looking at the symbol&nbsp;in the IV quadrant of the last figure in the series, we can determine that the figure in option 3 satisfies the necessary conditions.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Bubun.R_09-03-21_Savita_D14.png\" style=\"height: 73px; width: 450px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence, the figure in&nbsp;<strong>option (3) </strong>is the correct answer.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/mistake-point-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Mistake Points</u></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;In all the options only the centre symbol is different and the rests are same.</p>\n\n<p>On observing closely the star symbol, the number of the pointed tip&nbsp;and their direction is different in all the options.</p>\n\n<p>We choose option 3 on the basis of the last figure in the question series.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Bubun.R_09-03-21_Savita_D9.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Bubun.R_09-03-21_Savita_D10.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Bubun.R_09-03-21_Savita_D11.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Bubun.R_09-03-21_Savita_D12.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Bubun.R_09-03-21_Savita_D13.png",
        "//cdn.testbook.com/images/production/quesImages/quesImage5146.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Bubun.R_09-03-21_Savita_D14.png",
        "//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/mistake-point-image.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0bbd5d8f3f63-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "Select the figure that will replace the question mark (?) in the following figure series. Problem figures: Answer figures:",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Select the figure that will replace the question mark (?) in the following figure series.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Problem figures:</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Prashant_Madhuri_18.03.2021_D1.png\" style=\"width: 318px; height: 82px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Answer figures:</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Prashant_Madhuri_18.03.2021_D2.png\" style=\"width: 319px; height: 105px;\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "A",
          "html": "A"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "B",
          "html": "B"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "C",
          "html": "C"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "D",
          "html": "D"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>The pattern&nbsp;follows here is:</p>\n\n<p>Given series:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Prashant_Madhuri_18.03.2021_D1.png\" style=\"width: 318px; height: 82px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"https:https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/06/Common_Diagram_28.01.2020_D1.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>E + 2 = G, G + 2 = I, I + 2 = K. It is rotating in anti-clockwise direction.</p>\n\n<p>3<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 9, 4<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 16, 5<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 25, 6<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 36.&nbsp;It is rotating in anti-clockwise direction.</p>\n\n<p>2<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;= 8, 3<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;= 27, 4<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;= 64, 5<sup>3</sup>&nbsp;= 125.&nbsp;It is rotating in anti-clockwise direction.</p>\n\n<p>Z - 3&nbsp;= W, W - 3&nbsp;= T, T - 3 = Q.&nbsp;It is rotating in anti-clockwise direction.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Prashant_Madhuri_18.03.2021_D3.png\" style=\"width: 318px; height: 82px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;Option 1&quot;.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Prashant_Madhuri_18.03.2021_D1.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Prashant_Madhuri_18.03.2021_D2.png",
        "https:https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/06/Common_Diagram_28.01.2020_D1.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/03/F1_Prashant_Madhuri_18.03.2021_D3.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
