      "question": "Select the figure from among the given options that can replace the question mark (?) in the following series.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Select the figure from among the given options that can replace the question mark (?) in the following series.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F1_Shraddha_Puja%20T_25.01.2022_D29.png\" style=\"height: 83px; width: 400px;\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F1_Shraddha_Puja%20T_25.01.2022_D30.png\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F1_Shraddha_Puja%20T_25.01.2022_D31.png\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F1_Shraddha_Puja%20T_25.01.2022_D32.png\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F1_Shraddha_Puja%20T_25.01.2022_D33.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 82px;\" />"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>The logic followed here is:-</p>\n\n<p>&quot;E&quot; moves to top left&nbsp;side to the bottom right side, then bottom right side to bottom left side then bottom left side to middle and then middle to top right side.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F1_Shraddha_Puja%20T_25.01.2022_D35.png\" style=\" width: 410px; height: 113px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&quot;A&quot; moves to top right side to the top left side, then top left side to bottom right side then bottom right side to the bottom left side and then bottom left side to the middle.</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F1_Shraddha_Puja%20T_25.01.2022_D36.png\" style=\"width: 396px; height: 102px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&quot;U&quot; moves to the&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">middle to the top right side, then top right side to top left side then top left side to the bottom right side and then bottom right side to the bottom left side.</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F1_Shraddha_Puja%20T_25.01.2022_D37.png\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&quot;I&quot; moves to the&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">bottom left side to the middle, then the middle&nbsp;to the top right&nbsp;side then the top right&nbsp;side to the top left side and then the top left&nbsp;side to the bottom right side.</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F1_Shraddha_Puja%20T_25.01.2022_D38.png\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">&quot;O&quot; moves to the&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\">bottom right side to the bottom left side, then the bottom left side to the middle then the middle&nbsp;to the top right side and then the top right side to the top left side.</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/01/F1_Shraddha_Puja%20T_25.01.2022_D39.png\" style=\"width: 396px; height: 95px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">Hence, <strong>&quot;option 2&quot;</strong> is the correct answer.</span></p>\n",
