      "question": "Which option figure will replace the question mark in the following series:",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Which option figure will replace the question mark in the following series:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F3_Pooja%2014-10-21_Savita_D11.png\" style=\"width: 402px; height: 82px;\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F3_Pooja%2014-10-21_Savita_D12.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 82px;\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F3_Pooja%2014-10-21_Savita_D13.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 82px;\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F3_Pooja%2014-10-21_Savita_D14.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 82px;\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F3_Pooja%2014-10-21_Savita_D15.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 82px;\" />"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>1) B and D are moved alternatively. B is rotated 90&deg; anticlockwise and D is rotated 90&deg;clockwise.</p>\n\n<p>In next step B is rotated 90&deg; clockwise and D is rotated 90&deg;anticlockwise.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F3_Pooja%2014-10-21_Savita_D16.png\" style=\"width: 402px; height: 82px;\" />&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>2) F and Z are moved alternatively. Z is rotated 90&deg; clockwise and F is rotated 90&deg; clockwise.</p>\n\n<p>In next step Z and F rotated anticlockwise.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F3_Pooja%2014-10-21_Savita_D17.png\" style=\"width: 402px; height: 82px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>3) Middle figure is rotated 90&deg; clockwise in each step.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F3_Pooja%2014-10-21_Savita_D18.png\" style=\"width: 402px; height: 82px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>So, next figure is;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F3_Pooja%2014-10-21_Savita_D13.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 82px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence, <strong>option (2)</strong> is the correct answer.</p>\n",
