      "question": "Select the figure that will come next in the following figure series.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Select the figure that will come next in the following figure series.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F1_Mrunal_SSC_21.09.22_D33.png\" style=\"width: 396px; height: 82px;\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F1_Mrunal_SSC_21.09.22_D34.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 81px;\" /></p>\n"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F1_Mrunal_SSC_21.09.22_D35.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 81px;\" /></p>\n"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F1_Mrunal_SSC_21.09.22_D36.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 82px;\" /></p>\n"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F1_Mrunal_SSC_21.09.22_D37.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 82px;\" /></p>\n"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p><span style=\"\">The figure that will come next in the following figure series is shown below:</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">1) Triangle shift their position downward in next figure then moved upward in next figure and so on.</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">2) Arrow rotate clockwise one step in second figure, then rotate two&nbsp;step clockwise in third figure, then rotate three step clockwise in fourth figure at last rotate four step clockwise in last figure.&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"\">3) Star rotate anticlockwise one step in second figure, then rotate two step anticlockwise in third figure, then rotate three step anticlockwise in fourth figure at last rotate four step anticlockwise in last figure.</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/09/F1_Mrunal_SSC_21.09.22_D38_V2.png\" style=\"width: 397px; height: 260px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence, &lsquo;<strong>option 1</strong>&rsquo; is the correct answer.</p>\n",
